      "text": "3-ب) أثبت أن \\(A(\\alpha)=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}e\\alpha^2-e\\alpha+\\alpha\\right)ua\\).",
      "solution": {
        "strategy": "نستعمل أن α جذر للدالة.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "استعمال f(α)=0",
            "explanation": "\\[e^\\alpha-e\\alpha-1=0\\Rightarrow e^\\alpha=e\\alpha+1\\]",
            "result": "\\(e^\\alpha=e\\alpha+1\\)."
          },
          {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "التعويض",
            "explanation": "\\[A(\\alpha)=-(e\\alpha+1)+\\frac e2\\alpha^2+\\alpha+1\\]",
            "result": "نعوض علاقة الجذر."
          },
          {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "التبسيط",
            "explanation": "\\[A(\\alpha)=\\frac e2\\alpha^2-e\\alpha+\\alpha\\]",
            "result": "الصيغة المطلوبة."
          }
        ],
        "final_answer": "\\(\\boxed{A(\\alpha)=\\left(\\frac12e\\alpha^2-e\\alpha+\\alpha\\right)ua}\\).",
